WEBVTT

00:00:28.163 --> 00:00:32.097
with a strong focus
on technological solutions.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:36.563
He discusses the things we have,
such as wind and solar power,

00:00:36.597 --> 00:00:38.397
the things we need to develop,

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:41.697
such as carbon-free cement
or carbon-free steel,

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:44.663
and long-term energy storage.

00:00:44.697 --> 00:00:47.363
And he talks about
the economics of it all,

00:00:47.397 --> 00:00:50.863
introducing the concept of green premium.

00:00:50.863 --> 00:00:54.897
The gist of the book,
and really I'm simplifying here a lot,

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:58.397
is that fighting climate change
is going to be hard,

00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:00.763
but it's possible, we can do it.